{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mom6_shortwave",
  "description": "Stage-2 implementation of the MOM6 penetrating shortwave absorption (MOM6 dev/ncar_260909 @301879336, fork stage1/EqESM-cesm-mom6 branch instrument/mom6-dumps; in this MOM6 version the two routines live in MOM_opacity.F90: absorbRemainingSW :602-869, which heats the water column by the Beer-Lambert decay of the penetrating bands, and sumSWoverBands :894-1041, which accumulates the penetrating shortwave for the KPP buoyancy-flux path; the per-band surface split penSW_bnd = sw_pen_band*dt/(RHO_0*C_P) is extractFluxes1d of MOM_forcing_type.F90:619; run configuration C_JRA_t62_mom6_inst: OPACITY_SCHEME=OHLMANN_03 (chlorophyll-driven opacity_from_chl :247-479), N_SW_BANDS=2, RHO_0=1035 kg m-3, C_P=3992 J kg-1 K-1, all unit rescale factors 1.0). The component is written as math, not as the Fortran's loop: the optical depth at interface i is the measure-weighted cumulative sum tau(n,i) = sum_{j<i} opacity(n,j)*h(j), spelled with the sw_optical_depth expression template of ./mom6_templates.esm (an exp-of-prefix-sum form of the Beer-Lambert integral int_0^z opacity dz', esm-spec 4.3.1), applied once per thickness field the model uses: h = h_after (the post-flux thickness the heating path sees, absorbRemainingSW :748-750) for OD and once more with h = h_buoy = h_before (the pre-flux thickness of the KPP buoyancy path, thickness_to_dz via MOM_forcing_type.F90:1102) for OD_buoy. The remaining penetrating SW after layer k is pen_sw_rem(n,k) = penSW_bnd(n)*exp(-tau(n,k+1)) (absorbRemainingSW :752-753, 760-766), the layer heating is dT(k) = sum_n penSW_bnd(n)*exp(-tau(n,k))*(1 - exp(-opacity(n,k)*h(k)))/h(k) (absorbRemainingSW :775-777, 797-802), and the interface net penetrating flux is netPen(i) = sum_n penSW_bnd(n)*exp(-tau_buoy(n,i))/dt (sumSWoverBands :1000-1004). Coverage gap (see README-mom6-shortwave.md): absorbRemainingSW's min_SW_heat clamp (PEN_SW_FLUX_ABSORB = 2.5e-11 degC m s-1, PEN_SW_ABSORB_MINTHICK = 1.0 m, answer_date >= 20190101, :711-730) rewrites pen_sw_rem/dT below the layers where nsw*pen_sw_rem(n,k) < 2.5e-11*dt degC m; it is a stateful recurrence (the clamped remaining feeds the next layer), so it is not expressed as pure math here and those layers are pinned only via the conservation identity absorbed_total = sum_k dT(k)*h(k) (which the clamp preserves up to the ~1e-24 leftover). State units: sw_pen_band [W m-2], opacity [m-1], h/h_buoy [m], dt [s], penSW_bnd [degC m] (heating per step), OD/OD_buoy dimensionless, pen_sw_rem [degC m], dT [degC], netPen [degC m s-1], absorbed_total [degC m]. Pins: mom6_sw_abs.csv rows (joined to mom6_bflux.csv for h_after/h_before/dt) at rel 1e-12 within the unclamped region, extracted by stage1/analysis/make_mom6_sw_abs_tests.py.",
  "authors": [
   "EqESM stage 2 (wt/mom6-shortwave)"
  ]
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "band": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_BAND"
  },
  "layer": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_LAYER"
  },
  "iface": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_IFACE"
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_BAND": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 2
  },
  "N_LAYER": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 75
  },
  "N_IFACE": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 76
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "ShortwaveAbsorption": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./mom6_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "sw_pen_band": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "band"
     ],
     "units": "W m^-2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Penetrating shortwave flux entering the surface in each band (the dumped sw_pen_band_n column, the OHLMANN_03 surface split of the downwelling SW), [W m-2]"
    },
    "opacity": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "band",
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m^-1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Optical attenuation coefficient per band and layer (opacity_from_chl, MOM_opacity.F90:247-479; the dumped opacity_n_k column), [m-1]"
    },
    "h": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Layer thickness AFTER the boundary flux application, as seen by the heating path of absorbRemainingSW (the dumped h_after_k column of mom6_bflux.csv), [m]"
    },
    "h_buoy": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Layer thickness BEFORE the boundary flux application, as used by the sumSWoverBands/KPP buoyancy-flux path (thickness_to_dz via MOM_forcing_type.F90:1102; the dumped h_before_k column of mom6_bflux.csv), [m]"
    },
    "dt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 3600.0,
     "description": "Length of the coupling step over which the flux acts (the dumped dt column of mom6_bflux.csv), [s]"
    },
    "RHO_0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg m^-3",
     "default": 1035.0,
     "description": "MOM6 reference density used in the surface flux split (the run's RHO_0), [kg m-3]"
    },
    "C_P": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J kg^-1 degC^-1",
     "default": 3992.0,
     "description": "MOM6 specific heat used in the surface flux split (the run's C_P), [J kg-1 degC-1]"
    },
    "penSW_bnd": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "band"
     ],
     "units": "degC m",
     "description": "Per-band penetrating shortwave converted to a heating depth per step, penSW_bnd(n) = sw_pen_band(n)*dt/(RHO_0*C_P) (extractFluxes1d, MOM_forcing_type.F90:619), [degC m]"
    },
    "OD": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "band",
      "iface"
     ],
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "description": "Cumulative optical depth at interface i along the heating path, tau(n,i) = sum_{j<i} opacity(n,j)*h_after(j) (absorbRemainingSW :748-750), dimensionless"
    },
    "OD_buoy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "band",
      "iface"
     ],
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "description": "Cumulative optical depth at interface i along the buoyancy-flux path, tau(n,i) = sum_{j<i} opacity(n,j)*h_before(j) (sumSWoverBands :980-982 with the pre-flux thickness), dimensionless"
    },
    "pen_sw_rem": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "band",
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "degC m",
     "description": "Penetrating shortwave remaining at the bottom of layer k, pen_sw_rem(n,k) = penSW_bnd(n)*exp(-tau(n,k+1)) (absorbRemainingSW :752-753, 760-766), [degC m]"
    },
    "dT": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "degC",
     "description": "Layer heating by the absorbed shortwave, dT(k) = sum_n penSW_bnd(n)*exp(-tau(n,k))*(1 - exp(-opacity(n,k)*h(k)))/h(k) (absorbRemainingSW :775-777, 797-802), [degC]"
    },
    "netPen": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "iface"
     ],
     "units": "degC m s^-1",
     "description": "Net penetrating shortwave crossing interface i as a flux, netPen(i) = sum_n penSW_bnd(n)*exp(-tau_buoy(n,i))/dt (sumSWoverBands :1000-1004), [degC m s-1]"
    },
    "absorbed_total": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "degC m",
     "description": "Total shortwave heating absorbed in the water column, absorbed_total = sum_k dT(k)*h(k); a conservation pin (the sum of the model's dT_k*h_after_k), not a dump column, [degC m]"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "penSW_bnd",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "output_idx": [
       "b"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "b": {
        "from": "band"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "/",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "*",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "sw_pen_band",
            "b"
           ]
          },
          "dt"
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "*",
         "args": [
          "RHO_0",
          "C_P"
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      "args": [
       "sw_pen_band"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "OD",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "sw_optical_depth",
      "bindings": {
       "opacity": "opacity",
       "h": "h"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "OD_buoy",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "sw_optical_depth",
      "bindings": {
       "opacity": "opacity",
       "h": "h_buoy"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "pen_sw_rem",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "output_idx": [
       "b",
       "k"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "b": {
        "from": "band"
       },
       "k": {
        "from": "layer"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "*",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "penSW_bnd",
          "b"
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "exp",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "-",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "OD",
              "b",
              {
               "op": "+",
               "args": [
                "k",
                1
               ]
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      "args": [
       "penSW_bnd",
       "OD"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "dT",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "output_idx": [
       "k"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "k": {
        "from": "layer"
       },
       "b": {
        "from": "band"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "/",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "*",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "penSW_bnd",
            "b"
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "exp",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "-",
             "args": [
              {
               "op": "index",
               "args": [
                "OD",
                "b",
                "k"
               ]
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "-",
           "args": [
            1.0,
            {
             "op": "exp",
             "args": [
              {
               "op": "-",
               "args": [
                {
                 "op": "*",
                 "args": [
                  {
                   "op": "index",
                   "args": [
                    "opacity",
                    "b",
                    "k"
                   ]
                  },
                  {
                   "op": "index",
                   "args": [
                    "h",
                    "k"
                   ]
                  }
                 ]
                }
               ]
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "h",
          "k"
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      "args": [
       "penSW_bnd",
       "OD",
       "opacity",
       "h"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "netPen",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "output_idx": [
       "i"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "i": {
        "from": "iface"
       },
       "b": {
        "from": "band"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "/",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "*",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "penSW_bnd",
            "b"
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "exp",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "-",
             "args": [
              {
               "op": "index",
               "args": [
                "OD_buoy",
                "b",
                "i"
               ]
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        "dt"
       ]
      },
      "args": [
       "penSW_bnd",
       "OD_buoy"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "absorbed_total",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "output_idx": [],
      "reduce": "+",
      "ranges": {
       "k": {
        "from": "layer"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "*",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "dT",
          "k"
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "h",
          "k"
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      "args": [
       "dT",
       "h"
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
   "tests":    [
    {
     "id": "sw_g3j78_step1_t3600",
     "description": "mom6_sw_abs.csv row (cpl_step 1, tod 3600, gi 3, gj 78, i 7, j 82, lon -285.33333333333337, lat -69.50444906328708) joined to the mom6_bflux.csv row of the same (gi, gj, cpl_step, tod) for h_after/h_before/dt (dt = 3600.0 s).  Pins the unclamped absorbRemainingSW/sumSWoverBands law: pen_sw_rem at the deepest layers where the min_SW_heat clamp has not fired (band1 k20, band2 k7; the clamp rewrites layer k when nsw*pen_sw_rem(n,k) < 2.5e-11*dt degC m, MOM_opacity.F90:711-730, so the pinnable region ends where either band's remaining falls below that floor) plus surface/mid layers, dT at layers 1/3/7 (the deepest layer with BOTH bands still unclamped), netPen at interfaces 1/2/7, and absorbed_total = sum_k dT_k*h_after_k (a derived conservation pin, not a dump column; the clamp only shifts ~1e-24 degC m of the total).  Dump precision is es26.17, so the law pins at rel 1e-12.",
